<title>ESTONIA: PENNU SHARE ISSUE LIST FIXED APR 10.</title>
<headline>PENNU SHARE ISSUE LIST FIXED APR 10.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tallinn stock exchange will fix the list for the Pennu computer's share issue on April 10, the stock exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>April 4 will be the last day for cum dividend trade and Monday, April 7  will be ex-dividend trade, the stock exchnage said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
